  m_text: "\u2022 6+ Bonus, Boost or Mystery symbols trigger Bonus Game.\n\u2022
    Only Mystery and Bonus symbols appear on the reels.\n\u2022 You have 3 Re-Spins
    at the beginning of Bonus Game.\n\u2022 Each new Bonus symbol appearing on the
    reels, resets number of Re-Spins to 3.\n\u2022 Fortune Slide contain high value
    Bonus, Jackpot and Boost symbols only.\n\u2022 When Bonus Game ends, the values
    of all Bonus symbols are summed up and \n  Bonus Win is paid."
