  m_text: "\u2022 Boost symbol plus any Bonus or Mystery symbol triggers Boost Feature.\n\u2022
    During Boost Feature all Bonus symbols are summed up and added up with \n  the
    winning for the round.\n\u2022 The Boost symbol can appear:\n  o Only on the
    3rd reel during main game and Free Spins; \n  o On Fortune Slide during Bonus
    Game."
